<div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Leaf analysis</h1>
        <p>Getting your results</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image">
        <img src="/img/results.jpg" alt="Results">
    </div>
</div>

<div class="content">
    <p class="intro-text" style="text-align: justify;">
        <b><i><span style="font-size: 24px;">Analysis Results</span></i></b><br><br>

        The uploaded image was analyzed, and the detected crop is:<br><br>

        <b><span style="font-size: 20px;">{{cropName}}</span></b><br><br>

        {{#if cropPage}}
            <a href="/crops/{{cropPage}}" class="button">Learn more about {{cropPage}}</a>
        {{/if}}
        <br><br>
        <a href="/" class="button">Go Back to Home</a>
    </p>

    <div style="max-width: 400px; max-height: 400px; overflow: hidden; margin: 20px auto;">
        <img src="{{imagePath}}" alt="Uploaded Leaf" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; object-fit: contain;">
    </div>
</div>